{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Join the early access post-apocalyptic shooter crafted by a passionate solo developer.</i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with easy missions like taking down small-time raiders, and work your way up to tough challenges like facing powerful bosses. Hunt bounties, upgrade your gear, and explore a dangerous world where every challenge helps you grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gear up, dive in, and show the wasteland what you\u2019re made of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game starts out with easy missions showing you the basics. I'd recommend playing these or you can skip and go straight to the high action bounties.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>v0.1 is about 1-2 hours of gameplay</strong> and consist of a simple gameplay loop of taking a bounty, finding a raider and eliminating the raider. This will change in later versions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join now with an introductory low price for a limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459980/extras/steam-page-designs.png?t=1746605970\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Raider Bounties</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and eliminate raiders to earn cash and get to high difficulty objectives. Starts slow or use fast travel to get into high paced action.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mega Deluxe Art Style!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed, hand-crafted post-apocalyptic environments, created in a unique style, are waiting to fulfill your deepest post-apocalyptic desires!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buy Guns and Character Upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your hard earned cash to upgrade your arsenal!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Job Board</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Job board has endless missions to test out even high skilled gamers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New jobs, survival, character perks/leveling are coming soon with early access updates and content updates such as new locations, weapons, enemies &amp; more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2459980?t=1746605970","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2459980?t=1746605970","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459980/41bc9d8cb059bbb7a319416a6a987307c90971b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746605970","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459980/41bc9d8cb059bbb7a319416a6a987307c90971b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746605970","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Cartoon violence, cursing, crude language. "},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Updating roadmap. Coming soon!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Join the early access post-apocalyptic shooter crafted by a passionate solo developer.</i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with easy missions like taking down small-time raiders, and work your way up to tough challenges like facing powerful bosses. Hunt bounties, upgrade your gear, and explore a dangerous world where every challenge helps you grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gear up, dive in, and show the wasteland what you\u2019re made of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game starts out with easy missions showing you the basics. I'd recommend playing these or you can skip and go straight to the high action bounties.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>v0.1 is about 1-2 hours of gameplay</strong> and consist of a simple gameplay loop of taking a bounty, finding a raider and eliminating the raider. This will change in later versions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join now with an introductory low price for a limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459980/extras/steam-page-designs.png?t=1746605970\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Raider Bounties</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and eliminate raiders to earn cash and get to high difficulty objectives. Starts slow or use fast travel to get into high paced action.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mega Deluxe Art Style!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed, hand-crafted post-apocalyptic environments, created in a unique style, are waiting to fulfill your deepest post-apocalyptic desires!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buy Guns and Character Upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your hard earned cash to upgrade your arsenal!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Job Board</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Job board has endless missions to test out even high skilled gamers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New jobs, survival, character perks/leveling are coming soon with early access updates and content updates such as new locations, weapons, enemies &amp; more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["WastePunk"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459980/b8ae5cfb4309caad11a5aabca291623